{"text":"openapi: 3.0.3\ninfo:\n  title: Hive Works Maintenance Requests API\n  version: 1.0.0\n  description: Shared contract for the Hive Works maintenance web app and API.\nservers:\n  - url: /api\npaths:\n  /requests:\n    get:\n      operationId: listRequests\n      summary: List maintenance requests\n      description: Returns all requests or requests matching one supported status, newest first. Equal creation timestamps have no guaranteed relative order.\n      parameters:\n        - name: status\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          description: Optional single status filter.\n          schema:\n            $ref: '#/components/schemas/RequestStatus'\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Matching requests, newest first.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/RequestList'\n              example:\n                requests:\n                  - { id: 1, createdAt: '2026-03-18T09:00:00Z', title: Kitchen tap leaking, area: Kitchen, priority: Urgent, status: Open }\n                  - { id: 2, createdAt: '2026-03-17T09:00:00Z', title: \"Projector won't power on\", area: Meeting room, priority: Normal, status: In progress }\n                  - { id: 3, createdAt: '2026-03-16T09:00:00Z', title: Wobbly desk B-14, area: Open desk, priority: Low, status: Open }\n                  - { id: 4, createdAt: '2026-03-15T09:00:00Z', title: Hand dryer not working, area: Washroom, priority: Normal, status: Open }\n                  - { id: 5, createdAt: '2026-03-14T09:00:00Z', title: Loose floor tile by entrance, area: Reception, priority: Urgent, status: In progress }\n                  - { id: 6, createdAt: '2026-03-12T09:00:00Z', title: Fridge door seal worn, area: Kitchen, priority: Low, status: Done }\n                  - { id: 7, createdAt: '2026-03-11T09:00:00Z', title: Whiteboard rail coming loose, area: Meeting room, priority: Normal, status: Done }\n                  - { id: 8, createdAt: '2026-03-10T09:00:00Z', title: \"Monitor arm won't hold position\", area: Open desk, priority: Low, status: Open }\n                  - { id: 9, createdAt: '2026-03-09T09:00:00Z', title: Reception door closer slams, area: Reception, priority: Urgent, status: Open }\n                  - { id: 10, createdAt: '2026-03-07T09:00:00Z', title: Washroom sink draining slowly, area: Washroom, priority: Normal, status: Done }\n                  - { id: 11, createdAt: '2026-03-06T09:00:00Z', title: Ceiling light flickering, area: Meeting room, priority: Urgent, status: In progress }\n                  - { id: 12, createdAt: '2026-03-05T09:00:00Z', title: Kitchen cabinet hinge loose, area: Kitchen, priority: Low, status: Done }\n        '400':\n          description: The status filter is unsupported or malformed.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse'\n              example:\n                message: Status must be Open, In progress, or Done.\n                errors:\n                  status: [Unsupported status filter.]\n        '500':\n          description: The request list could not be loaded.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse'\n              example:\n                message: Could not load requests.\n    post:\n      operationId: createRequest\n      summary: Create a maintenance request\n      description: Trims title and description before validation and storage. The API assigns id, createdAt, and Open status itself; optional caller-supplied values for those system-controlled fields are ignored. A description that is absent or blank after trimming is omitted from the resource.\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              $ref: '#/components/schemas/CreateRequest'\n            example:\n              title: Kitchen tap leaking\n              area: Kitchen\n              priority: Urgent\n              description: Water is pooling under the sink.\n      responses:\n        '201':\n          description: The created request with system-assigned fields.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/MaintenanceRequest'\n              example:\n                id: 13\n                createdAt: '2026-03-19T10:30:00Z'\n                title: Kitchen tap leaking\n                area: Kitchen\n                priority: Urgent\n                status: Open\n                description: Water is pooling under the sink.\n        '400':\n          description: Malformed JSON, invalid field types, missing or invalid fields, or invalid values. No request is created.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse'\n              example:\n                message: Request validation failed.\n                errors:\n                  title: [Title must be 3 to 80 characters.]\n                  area: [Area is required.]\n                  description: [Description must be at most 500 characters.]\n        '500':\n          description: The request could not be created.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse'\n              example:\n                message: Could not create the request.\n  /requests/{id}:\n    parameters:\n      - name: id\n        in: path\n        required: true\n        description: System-generated integer request ID.\n        schema:\n          type: integer\n          format: int64\n          minimum: 1\n    get:\n      operationId: getRequest\n      summary: Get a maintenance request\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: The matching request.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/MaintenanceRequest'\n              example:\n                id: 2\n                createdAt: '2026-03-17T09:00:00Z'\n                title: \"Projector won't power on\"\n                area: Meeting room\n                priority: Normal\n                status: In progress\n        '404':\n          description: No request has this ID.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse'\n              example:\n                message: Request not found.\n        '500':\n          description: The request could not be loaded for a non-not-found reason.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse'\n              example:\n                message: Could not load the request.\n  /requests/{id}/status:\n    parameters:\n      - name: id\n        in: path\n        required: true\n        description: System-generated integer request ID.\n        schema:\n          type: integer\n          format: int64\n          minimum: 1\n    patch:\n      operationId: changeRequestStatus\n      summary: Change a request's status\n      description: Only status is mutable. Allowed transitions are Open to In progress, In progress to Done, and Done to Open. Requests with immutable fields or other extra properties are rejected.\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              $ref: '#/components/schemas/ChangeRequestStatus'\n            example:\n              status: Done\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: The request with its updated status.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/MaintenanceRequest'\n              example:\n                id: 2\n                createdAt: '2026-03-17T09:00:00Z'\n                title: \"Projector won't power on\"\n                area: Meeting room\n                priority: Normal\n                status: Done\n        '400':\n          description: Unsupported status value or attempt to change an immutable field.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse'\n              example:\n                message: Status must be Open, In progress, or Done; only status may be changed.\n                errors:\n                  status: [Unsupported status value.]\n        '404':\n          description: No request has this ID.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse'\n              example:\n                message: Request not found.\n        '409':\n          description: The requested status transition is not allowed from the current status.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse'\n              example:\n                message: This status transition is not allowed.\n        '500':\n          description: The status could not be updated.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse'\n              example:\n                message: Could not update the request.\ncomponents:\n  schemas:\n    RequestArea:\n      type: string\n      enum: [Kitchen, Meeting room, Open desk, Washroom, Reception]\n    RequestPriority:\n      type: string\n      enum: [Low, Normal, Urgent]\n    RequestStatus:\n      type: string\n      enum: [Open, In progress, Done]\n    MaintenanceRequest:\n      type: object\n      additionalProperties: false\n      required: [id, createdAt, title, area, priority, status]\n      properties:\n        id:\n          type: integer\n          format: int64\n          minimum: 1\n          description: System-generated request ID.\n        createdAt:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n          description: System-generated UTC timestamp.\n        title:\n          type: string\n          minLength: 3\n          maxLength: 80\n        area:\n          $ref: '#/components/schemas/RequestArea'\n        priority:\n          $ref: '#/components/schemas/RequestPriority'\n        status:\n          $ref: '#/components/schemas/RequestStatus'\n        description:\n          type: string\n          maxLength: 500\n    CreateRequest:\n      type: object\n      additionalProperties: false\n      required: [title, area, priority]\n      description: Title and description are trimmed before validation and storage. Optional id, createdAt, or status inputs are ignored and replaced by system values.\n      properties:\n        title:\n          type: string\n          minLength: 3\n          maxLength: 80\n        area:\n          $ref: '#/components/schemas/RequestArea'\n        priority:\n          $ref: '#/components/schemas/RequestPriority'\n        description:\n          type: string\n          maxLength: 500\n        id:\n          type: integer\n          format: int64\n          description: Optional caller-supplied value is ignored.\n        createdAt:\n          type: string\n          format: date-time\n          description: Optional caller-supplied value is ignored.\n        status:\n          allOf:\n            - $ref: '#/components/schemas/RequestStatus'\n          description: Optional caller-supplied value is ignored; created requests start Open.\n    ChangeRequestStatus:\n      type: object\n      additionalProperties: false\n      required: [status]\n      properties:\n        status:\n          $ref: '#/components/schemas/RequestStatus'\n    RequestList:\n      type: object\n      additionalProperties: false\n      required: [requests]\n      properties:\n        requests:\n          type: array\n          items:\n            $ref: '#/components/schemas/MaintenanceRequest'\n    ErrorResponse:\n      type: object\n      additionalProperties: false\n      required: [message]\n      properties:\n        message:\n          type: string\n        errors:\n          type: object\n          description: Field-keyed validation messages when applicable.\n          additionalProperties:\n            type: array\n            items:\n              type: string\n"}